<h2>The three provisions in outline</h2>

<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Provision</th><th>What it covers</th><th>Punishment</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Section 16</td><td>Defines abetment: instigation, conspiracy with an act in pursuance, intentional aiding — including facilitation, misrepresentation and concealment</td><td>Definition only; operates through Section 17</td></tr>
